"                        all Payslips marked as done/paid during the period stipulated below will be displayed. Review the items and remove any that\n"
"                        you don't need in your report. If some are missing, you can always add them manually using the \"Add a line\" option. It is\n"
"                        important that you compare the CSV file generated by Odoo with the template your 3rd party service requests before filing it."
msgstr ""

#. module: l10n_us_hr_payroll
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:l10n_us_hr_payroll.l10n_us_w2_view_form
msgid ""
"A CSV file containing the information you need to e-file W2s through a 3rd "
"party service will be generated. By default, all Payslips marked as "
"validated/paid during the period stipulated below will be displayed. Review "
"the items and remove any that you don't need in your report. If some are "
"missing you can always add them manually using the \"Add a line\" option. It"
" is important that you compare the CSV file generated by Odoo with the "
"template your 3rd party service requests before filing it."
msgstr ""

